# Overture: what a first visit performs, about fifteen seconds, no model call.
# A calm welcome in the language itself: what Conduit is in three short lines,
# then seven starters that reach across lessons, diagrams, dashboards, mock-ups,
# pages, music and explorables. A starter's text is what is sent to the model
# when it is tapped, so each is a prompt that has been run live. It sets no
# look of its own: it is drawn in whichever look the person has, with colour
# roles only, so paper and night both hold.

scene hello stack calm lines=3 align=center
say size=xl enter=fade dur=0.8s | Ask anything.
wait 0.4
say size=l enter=fade dur=0.6s | The answer arrives as a drawing you can tap, drag and talk back to.
wait 1.2
say size=m enter=fade dur=0.6s | It stays on the stage, so Claude builds on it.
wait 1.4

scene try stack brisk lines=1 align=center
say size=l enter=fade dur=0.4s | Ask anything. Or try one.
wait 0.3
say choice size=m @13 enter=fade dur=0.3s | Teach my 7-year-old division
say choice size=m @13 enter=fade dur=0.3s | Explain how a heat pump works
say choice size=m @13 enter=fade dur=0.3s | Mock up a dashboard of Apple's fiscal 2025 results
say choice size=m @13 enter=fade dur=0.3s | Mock up an app screen
say choice size=m @13 enter=fade dur=0.3s | Render me a real webpage for a small coffee roaster
say choice size=m @13 enter=fade dur=0.3s | Make a little piano I can play
say choice size=m @13 enter=fade dur=0.3s | Let me explore how compound interest grows with the rate
